  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3202.08 Light-duty vehicle",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3202.08 “Light-duty vehicle” means any passenger vehicle or derivation of such a vehicle capable of seating 12 persons or less.\n\nSource. #7731, eff 7-26-02 (See Revision Note #2 at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 3200) (formerly Saf-C 3201.052); ss by #9184, eff 6-20-08; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16 (from Saf-C 3202.06); ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16 (from Saf-C 3202.06)",
